{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103680","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103680","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1710368001:0":{"text":"どうして、魔物がこんなに！？カスティー、まだ持ちこたえられる！？","source_cn":"……为什么会突然出现这么多魔物！科丝蒂，你还能撑住吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB5A80060D4172E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710368002:1":{"text":"……大丈夫です！ペギー様と皆さんを、必ずお守りいたします！","source_cn":"……我还能坚持！绝对不能让它们伤害公主殿下和大家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA68C11DB37C4EC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710368003:1":{"text":"終わった……終わりだ……ああ、デューラ様、どうかお助けください！","source_cn":"完了……全完了……艾雅在上，请女神保佑……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB224E6AA7B3F7DE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710368004:1":{"text":"ダオニス！祈ってる暇があったら、助かる方法を考えなさいよ！","source_cn":"坦尼斯！现在祈祷有什么用？不如想点实际的办法！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3565B19F8568520","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710368005:1":{"text":"姫様、魔物が次々と押し寄せております。私とカスティー殿だけでは、皆さまをお守りしきれないかもしれません……！","source_cn":"殿下，魔物源源不断，仅凭我和宫廷魔法师恐怕无法护住所有人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83B47C0A3258F973","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710368006:1":{"text":"他の方たちを連れて、ここから離れてください！私が殿を務めます！","source_cn":"请您带着大家继续往后撤离，我来断后！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8EE032AD6E604E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710368007:1":{"text":"離れるって……後ろの道は塞がれているのよ！どこへ行けば……！","source_cn":"往后撤离？！后面的路被堵上了，哪有地方可去……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFBAF3C664FFE288","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710368008:1":{"text":"逃げ場はないし、あなたたちも、そう長くは持たないわ！","source_cn":"后面是死路！你们也撑不了多久的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x624CCAAAD3338F73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710368009:1":{"text":"……まだ、方法はある。一瞬で形勢を逆転させて、ここにいる全員を守れる方法が……！","source_cn":"……不，还有一个办法。一个能够瞬间逆转局势，保护所有人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78EF34E9DD5939A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710368010:1":{"text":"ペギーの視線が、巨大な岩に突き立つ長剣へ向けられる。それに気付いた皆も、すぐに彼女の意図を悟った。","source_cn":"佩吉的目光落在了那把插在巨石之中的长剑上，而所有人顺着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0499D5102D8958C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710368011:1":{"text":"殿下！ま、まさか……！？","source_cn":"公主殿下！您……您难道是想……？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6102BEE72578AF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1710368012:1":{"text":"第一次神魔大戦で、デューラ様がローランド・オーガスタに授けた聖剣。ローランド大帝は、あれで魔物を討ち滅ぼし、ブライト王国を築いた。","source_cn":"第一次神魔大战时，艾雅女神赐予了罗兰·奥古斯塔这把圣剑...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A7510DE5C0C89EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1710368013:1":{"text":"その剣を……<style=\"highlight\">カリバーン</style>を手にすることができれば……！","source_cn":"那把剑……<style=highlight>石中剑</...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE124CA749EFF9F47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1710368014:1":{"text":"なりません、殿下！あれは王権継承を象徴する神器なのですぞ！","source_cn":"绝对不行！公主殿下！那是象征王权继承的神器！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x357BCA34E519DA4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1710368015:1":{"text":"抜剣の儀に参加する継承者以外、それに触れることは許されません！国の法に背くおつもりですか！","source_cn":"依照耀光律法，唯有举行拔剑仪式时，候选继承者方可尝试触...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0255591828D086DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1710368016:1":{"text":"陛下がご在位の今、独断で剣を抜くのは越権行為――いや、謀反になりますぞ！","source_cn":"陛下尚在，您若此刻私自拔剑，那就是僭越！是谋逆！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50F753D3370BFFF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1710368017:1":{"text":"姫様、大法官殿の言うとおりです。抜剣は王位に関わる国の一大事。軽率に判断すべきではありません。","source_cn":"殿下……大法官说得没错。拔剑之举事关大统，不可如此轻率...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E0105A78ED462F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1710368018:1":{"text":"軽率？ヘンドリック卿、コルネリウス卿、あなたたちには周りが見えてないの！？","source_cn":"轻率？亨德里克卿，康拉德卿。看看你们周围！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE82B4F3D2988E663","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1710368019:1":{"text":"今剣を抜かなかったら、全員ここで死んでしまうかもしれないのよ！","source_cn":"如果我现在不拔剑，这里的所有人都可能会死！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0431585BA2BA8223","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1710368020:1":{"text":"ですが――","source_cn":"可是——<key:dialog3>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1783113FC203172F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1710368021:1":{"text":"私はブライトの王女。この体には、オーガスタ家の血が流れているわ。今